      "text": [
        "Frequently asked questions",
        "By creating a smooth, branded journey from click to delivery. Real-time tracking, personalised unboxings, embedded FAQs, and self-serve delivery updates cut down on customer service time by over 30 hours per month — while maintaining a 95% satisfaction rate.",
        "To scale fast while staying true to its eco-conscious values. With Bigblue, Unbottled ships over 1,000 orders per day and restocks 1,000+ Sephora stores and pharmacies across Europe within 48 hours — using plastic-free packaging and carbon-neutral delivery options.",
        "We have nine fulfilment centres in Europe to ship everywhere in the world.",
        "We have six warehouses in France, including Bigblue’s Fashion Warehouse and our Ecocert BIO-certified fulfilment centre.One warehouse is located on the outskirts of Madrid, Spainn one warehouse outside of London, United Kingdom and one in Dormagen, in Germany.",
        "Yes! We offer sustainable last-mile delivery options and plastic-free packaging.",
        "To meet the logistics challenges of the future, we have implemented tangible actions that we hold close to our hearts. For more details, read Bigblue’s commitment to greener logistics.",
        "Bigblue's pricing includes a fulfilment services fee, a subscription to Bigblue's App, and optional experience packs for Conversion, Delivery, and Returns, which are based on usage.",
        "A subscription to Bigblue's App is necessary to access our fulfilment services. Discounts on the fulfilment services fee are available as your monthly order volume increases.",
        "How does Bigblue help Unbottled deliver a premium customer experience?",
        "Why did Unbottled choose Bigblue to manage its logistics?",
